        "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/permalink.php?story_fbid=pfbid02ZyLfFziM7RSEqE6ZkiujsrspKox649JQ7ibQHKdiy7uEuwvLXVhQvbfZRoYmRbKhl&id=61594197356279",
        "fields": {
          "message": {
            "kind": "VALUE",
            "value": "BEFORE YOU BOOK: 4 QUESTIONS ABOUT YOUR FIRST BAZI READING\n1. What can I ask about?\nChoose one question about love, career or life direction. A specific situation gives your written reading a clearer focus.\n2. How do I phrase my question?\nTry a question that leaves room for reflection and your own judgment. For example:\n• What should I consider before changing careers?\n• What recurring relationship pattern would I like to understand?\n• What should I reflect on as I choose my next step?\nThese are example questions, not predictions or customer cases.\n3. What should I prepare?\nWrite one clear question and a little relevant background. Use the booking form for your birth details and personal information; please don’t post them in public comments. You can review your order before payment.\n4. Can a reading guarantee what will happen?\nNo. BaZi is used here as a traditional framework for reflection. Your choices remain your own. This service does not answer crisis, medical or pregnancy, gambling, legal-outcome or investment-return questions.\nBefore deciding, explore the illustrative sample, full FAQ and service details:\nhttps://reading.easternwisdomstudio.com/en\n#BaZi #EasternWisdom"
