        "fields": {
          "message": {
            "kind": "VALUE",
            "value": "WELCOME TO EASTERNWISDOM — START HERE\nNew to BaZi? You’re in the right place.\nBaZi, also known as the Four Pillars, is a traditional Chinese framework for reflecting on personal patterns and life choices. We offer private written readings in English, focused on one question about love, career or life direction.\nHere we’ll share simple BaZi explanations, ways to ask a focused question, and what a personal reading includes.\nOur one-question reading is $10, with a written answer within 24 hours and one written clarification within 7 days. No subscription.\nA reading offers a perspective for reflection; it does not guarantee a future outcome.\nView an illustrative sample and service details:\nhttps://reading.easternwisdomstudio.com/en\n#BaZi #EasternWisdom"
